Package: zoomriya-connect
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Remote access on the box, with no ZOOMRIYA server
 zoomriya-connectd lets the family's paired phones and laptops reach the box
 from home and from away. It pairs devices at home, keeps the box's own list
 of them, and lets in nobody else, on every path. No ZOOMRIYA server, relay
 or account is involved.
